<Base title="How we work" description="How Listika selects, checks and presents information in its local lists.">
  <div class="wrap prose-layout"><div class="index-line"><span><a href="/">THE INDEX</a> / EDITORIAL</span><span>LISTIKA</span></div><p class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH / 02</p><h1>How we work.</h1><div class="prose"><p class="opening">A useful list should make it easier to find information and understand where it came from.</p><h2>Selection</h2><p>We choose a clear topic for each list and include entries relevant to it. Inclusion is an editorial decision, not a paid ranking.</p><h2>Sources and updates</h2><p>Entries link to the source we checked and show a check date. We write our own summaries. Information, opening hours, prices and availability may change, so please confirm important details directly with the source before making plans.</p><h2>Advertising</h2><p>Advertising, when shown, is separate from editorial content. Advertisers do not buy inclusion or a place in our lists.</p></div></div>
</Base>
